#: src/Modules/Comms/Template/TemplateGuide.php
msgid "Says a development talk has been signed off and asks to read and confirm it."
msgstr "Meldt dat een ontwikkelgesprek is ondertekend en vraagt het te lezen en te bevestigen."

#: src/Modules/Comms/Template/TemplateGuide.php
msgid "The player and the parents, by the child's age as for other messages about a player, and parents only when the child shares the development plan with them."
msgstr "De speler en de ouders, naar de leeftijd van het kind zoals bij andere berichten over een speler, en ouders alleen als het kind het ontwikkelplan met hen deelt."

#: src/Modules/Comms/Template/TemplateGuide.php
msgid "When the trainer signs off a conversation form."
msgstr "Als de trainer een gespreksformulier ondertekent."

#: src/Modules/Comms/Templates/PdpConversationSignedTemplate.php
msgid "PDP conversation ready to read and confirm"
msgstr "POP-gesprek klaar om te lezen en te bevestigen"

#: src/Modules/Comms/Templates/PdpConversationSignedTemplate.php
msgid "{player_name}'s development talk is ready to read"
msgstr "Het ontwikkelgesprek van {player_name} is klaar om te lezen"

#: src/Modules/Comms/Templates/PdpConversationSignedTemplate.php
msgid ""
"Hi {recipient_first_name},\n"
"\n"
"{player_name}'s development talk ({conversation_name}) has been signed off. "
"You can read the scores, the strongest quality and the two development "
"points, and confirm that you have read them.\n"
"\n"
"Open it here: {deep_link}\n"
"\n"
"The coaching team"
msgstr ""
"Hoi {recipient_first_name},\n"
"\n"
"Het ontwikkelgesprek van {player_name} ({conversation_name}) is ondertekend. "
"Je kunt de scores, de grootste kwaliteit en de twee ontwikkelpunten lezen, "
"en bevestigen dat je ze hebt gelezen.\n"
"\n"
"Open het hier: {deep_link}\n"
"\n"
"Het trainersteam"

#: src/Modules/Comms/Templates/PdpConversationSignedTemplate.php
msgid "Development talk ready"
msgstr "Ontwikkelgesprek klaar"

#: src/Modules/Comms/Templates/PdpConversationSignedTemplate.php
msgid "{player_name}'s development talk ({conversation_name}) is ready to read. Open it to confirm."
msgstr "Het ontwikkelgesprek van {player_name} ({conversation_name}) is klaar om te lezen. Open het om te bevestigen."

